---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Panel from '../components/Panel.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---

<Base title="About" description="Applied AI engineer finishing a CS master's at Utah State.">
  <div class="column">
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I'm an applied AI engineer finishing a CS master's at Utah State. I like owning problems end to end,
        from the product call to the code, and I'm happiest building with smart people at the edge of what's
        possible.
      </p>

      <h2>How I work</h2>
      <p>
        I love cross-functional teams. I do my best work when I own the problem: making the technical and
        product decisions, and explaining them to the people they affect. Most recently that meant co-founding <a href="/projects/puente">Puente</a>, where I built a credit-building remittance app that moved real
        money to Mexico. Before that, I interned at Amazon and Cadence, and was technical co-founder of CompliRent, a startup in BYU's incubator.
      </p>

      <h2>What I'm looking for</h2>
      <p>
        Roles where I'm surrounded by smart people, building the future today, on the frontier of the
        technology. I finish my MS in May 2027.
      </p>

      <h2>Off the clock</h2>
      <p>
        Climbing <a href="/writing/seventeen-hours-on-the-grand">big mountains</a>, arguing about soccer,
        building <a href="/projects/soundtracks">an app for the memories tied to songs</a>, learning Latin
        dancing, and trying to cook a genuinely good steak.
      </p>
    </div>

    <Panel title="Transfer history" class="history">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="label" scope="col">Years</th>
            <th class="label" scope="col">Club</th>
            <th class="label" scope="col">Move</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {
            profile.history.map((h) => (
              <tr>
                <td class="num">{h.years}</td>
                <td>{h.club}</td>
                <td class="move">{h.move}</td>
              </tr>
            ))
          }
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </Panel>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Email me at <a href="mailto:jsphelps12@gmail.com">jsphelps12@gmail.com</a>, find me on <a href="https://github.com/jsphelps12">GitHub</a> or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/joshua-s-phelps">LinkedIn</a>, or read my <a href="/resume.pdf">resume</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .column {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .column :global(.history) {
    margin: var(--space-6) 0 var(--space-4);
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
  }
  th {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 0 var(--space-3) var(--space-2) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  td {
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3) var(--space-2) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }
  .num {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .move {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
